elieves them because seriously? We were transplanted by aliens from the stars?<br /> <br /> Alternately, they might really have no links to Earth--novas are more than capable of whipping up cloning facilities, after all.<br /> <br /> And of courew the quantum 10 barrier gives us the perfect reason why this stuff it out there... They touched the final frontier... and just lost interest, like an adult realizing they're no longer interested in Childish things.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-18T21:10:05-08:00","id":1428982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1426917-pre-nova-era-colonies?p=1428313#post1428313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/Distant_Origin_(episode\" target=\"_blank\">https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki...rigin_(episode</a>)</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to mention, the Silurian Hypotesis from a couple years ago.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Silurian_hypothesis\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\